{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17135","headline":"青云干吕 · 林藻","name":"青云干吕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应节偏干吕，亭亭在紫氛。\n缀空初布影，捧日已成文。\n结盖祥光迥，爲楼翠色分。\n还同起封上，更似出横汾。\n作瑞来藩国，呈形表圣君。\n裴回如有托，谁道比闲云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}